{"id": "3295633", "name": "כופלי לגרנז' – הנקודות על אליפסה הקרובה והרחוקה ביותר מישר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "coefTerm", "params": ["c", "s"], "body": "if c=1 then s\n else sconcat(string(c),s)"}, {"name": "leadTerm", "params": ["c", "v"], "body": "if c=1 then v\n else sconcat(string(c),v)"}, {"name": "signedTerm", "params": ["c", "v"], "body": "if c=1 then sconcat(\"+\",v)\n elseif c=-1 then sconcat(\"-\",v)\n elseif c>0 then sconcat(\"+\",string(c),v)\n else sconcat(string(c),v)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 920px; margin: auto; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 20px;\">הנקודות הקרובה והרחוקה ביותר מישר</strong>\n<p>נתונה האליפסה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 19px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<p>וכן הישר</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 19px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\)</div>\n<p>מצאו על האליפסה את הנקודה הקרובה ביותר לישר ואת הנקודה הרחוקה ביותר ממנו, וכן את המרחקים המתאימים.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">א. הנקודה הקרובה ביותר</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 12px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 10px;\">\\(x=\\) [[input:ans1]]    \\(y=\\) [[input:ans2]] <br>[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ב. הנקודה הרחוקה ביותר</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 12px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 10px;\">\\(x=\\) [[input:ans3]]    \\(y=\\) [[input:ans4]] <br>[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ג. המרחקים</strong>\n<p>הזינו את המרחק הקטן ביותר ואת המרחק הגדול ביותר מן הישר.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 12px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 10px;\">\\(d_{\\min}=\\) [[input:ans5]]     \\(d_{\\max}=\\) [[input:ans6]] <br>[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 920px; margin: auto; text-align: right; line-height: 1.72; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">1. פונקציית המרחק</strong>\n<p>המרחק של נקודה \\((x,y)\\) מן הישר הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle d(x,y)= \\frac{\\lvert {{CT:2}}\\rvert} {\\sqrt{{{CT:3}}}} \\)</div>\n<p>הישר נבחר כך שאינו חותך את האליפסה. לכן הביטוי שבתוך הערך המוחלט אינו מחליף סימן על האליפסה, ומספיק למצוא את המקסימום והמינימום של הביטוי הליניארי שבאגף שמאל של משוואת הישר.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">2. כופלי לגראנז'</strong>\n<p>נגדיר את אילוץ האליפסה באמצעות</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle g(x,y)= {{CT:4}}{{CT:5}}^{2} + {{CT:6}}{{CT:7}}^{2} -{{CT:8}} \\)</div>\n<p>מחפשים את נקודות הקיצון של \\({{CT:9}}\\) תחת האילוץ \\(g=0\\). כלומר פותרים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle \\nablaigl({{CT:9}}\\bigr) = \\lambda\\nabla g \\)</div>\n<p>מתקבלות שתי נקודות מנוגדות על האליפסה:</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #F4F1F5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_{\\mathrm{near}}={{CT:10}}, \\qquad P_{\\mathrm{far}}={{CT:11}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">3. המרחקים</strong>\n<p>מציבים את שתי הנקודות בנוסחת המרחק ומקבלים</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #F4F1F5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle d_{\\min}={{CT:12}}, \\qquad d_{\\max}={{CT:13}} \\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pnear]] [[feedback:pfar]] [[feedback:pdist]] [[feedback:porder]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "pdist", "value": 0.4, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "d1:if is(equal(radcan(ans5-tans5),0)) then 1 else 0;d2:if is(equal(radcan(ans6-tans6),0)) then 1 else 0;ds:(d1+d2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "ds", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pdist-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">מרחקים נכונים: <strong>{@d1+d2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pdist-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pfar", "value": 0.25, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "f1:if is(equal(radcan(ans3-tans3),0)) then 1 else 0;f2:if is(equal(radcan(ans4-tans4),0)) then 1 else 0;fs:(f1+f2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "fs", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfar-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קואורדינטות נכונות בנקודה הרחוקה: <strong>{@f1+f2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pfar-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pnear", "value": 0.25, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "n1:if is(equal(radcan(ans1-tans1),0)) then 1 else 0;n2:if is(equal(radcan(ans2-tans2),0)) then 1 else 0;ns:(n1+n2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "ns", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pnear-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קואורדינטות נכונות בנקודה הקרובה: <strong>{@n1+n2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pnear-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "porder", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "bad:if is(ans5>ans6)=true then 1 else 0;ord:1-bad;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ord", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background: #FFF4E5; border: 1px solid #F3C778; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #8a4b08;\">המרחק הקטן ביותר שהזנתם גדול מן המרחק הגדול ביותר! זה לא הגיוני!</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["H", "Pfar", "Pnear", "avec", "bvec", "coefX", "coefY", "cx", "cy", "dirpair", "dispA", "dispB", "dispR", "ellipseDisplay", "farDist", "gap", "k", "lineDisplay", "linearDisplay", "nearDist", "residualDisplay", "rhs", "rhsEll", "side", "tans1", "tans2", "tans3", "tans4", "tans5", "tans6", "xShift", "xfar", "xnear", "yShift", "yfar", "ynear"], "nvariants": 50}